    #### Testing
    
    - [ ] **Boundary / edge-case coverage**: Automated A5 coverage for
    empty, fully invalid, and trailing-invalid sparse-index ranges remains
    pending.
    - [ ] **Regression test**: A regression test for the
    trailing-invalid-index output issue remains pending.
    - [ ] **Error / failure path coverage**: Abnormal sparse-index paths
    have been addressed in code, but dedicated automated coverage remains
    pending.
    - [ ] **Meaningful & reliable tests**: No new tests were added; manual
    performance results and current static checks are reported above.
    - [ ] **Performance impact**: Real A5 benchmark results are attached
    above, including the regressed 128K/16-request case; automated
    performance regression coverage remains pending.
    
    
